| TransformStream wrappers | `"anonyma/stream"` |
| Span engine: pipelines, span detectors, replacers, chunk-safe streams | `"anonyma/engine"` |
| Tokenizers, key ring, token vault, rotation | `"anonyma/vault"` |
| Zero-PII audit log and verification | `"anonyma/audit"` |
| Regulation profiles, policies, erasure planning | `"anonyma/compliance"` |
| JSON and chat-message sanitizers, LLM guard | `"anonyma/ai"` |
| MCP declarations and server | `"anonyma/mcp"` |
| HTTP payload scrubbing (Express, Hono, Fetch) | `"anonyma/middleware"`, `"anonyma/middleware/express"`, `"anonyma/middleware/hono"` |

