## Compliance Strategy Mapping

| Regulation | Strategy | Categories focus |
|---|---|---|
| GDPR | `pseudonymize` | All personal data identifiers |
| LGPD | `redact` | Personal data, including the CPF |
| PIPEDA | `redact` | Personal information, including the SIN |
| HIPAA | `redact` | Safe Harbor identifiers that can be detected in text (ZIP codes, other dates, devices, biometrics and photos need field-level rules) |
| PCI-DSS | `redact`; `mask` (last 4) for credit-card and bank-account | Cardholder data (no detector for CVV, track data or PINs) |
| CCPA | `redact` | Consumer identifiers, financial and health data, online activity |
| FERPA | `redact` | Student education records |
| SOX | `redact` | Financial records and corporate officer identifiers |

The profiles in `src/compliance/regulations.ts` are authoritative where they differ from this table.

